  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xF6;d till decentralisering och h&#xE5;llbar lokal utveckling i Georgien</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Decentralization and  Sustainable Local Development in  Georgia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Based on theory of change the contribution overall objective defined as: Promote democratic, effective, and accountable local self-governments and sustainable local development in Georgia.

The specific objectives are: 

1.Contributing to building capacity in municipalities to implement delegated tasks using  participatory approaches. 

2.Contributing to inclusive and evidence-based decentralization reform in Georgia. 

3.Advocating decentralization reform and strengthening multi-level governance on local development.

Outcome of the first specific objective should be:

&#x2022; Georgian municipalities have knowledge and institutional capacity to implement delegated tasks related to urban planning and development.

&#x2022; Stronger representative democracy on local level.

&#x2022; Georgian municipalities use modern approaches and tools for good governance and sustainable development.

Outcome of the second specific objective should be:

&#x2022; Central authorities have institutional capacity for effective management of decentralization reform.

&#x2022; Agency for Spatial Planning and Urban Development of Georgia (SUDA) has capacity to monitor, coordinate and provide service to municipalities on urban planning and development.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet kommer att ge st&#xF6;d till kommuner, st&#xE4;rka deras kapacitet att fullg&#xF6;ra sina mandat och spela en grundl&#xE4;ggande roll f&#xF6;r demokratisk och h&#xE5;llbar utveckling i Georgien. Syftet &#xE4;r ocks&#xE5; att bidra till en evidensbaserad utformning av politiken och att st&#xE4;rka anv&#xE4;ndningen av b&#xE4;sta praxis vid samr&#xE5;d mellan central och lokal niv&#xE5; samt flerniv&#xE5;styre. Det kommer att kopplas till kraven i Georgiens process f&#xF6;r EU-anslutning, K&#xF6;penhamnskriterierna och 
genomf&#xF6;randet av Agenda 2030.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will provide support to municipalities, strengthen their capacities to fulfill their mandates and play a fundamental role in democratic and sustainable development in Georgia. It also will aim to contribute to evidence-based policy formulation, and to strengthening the use of best practice in central-local consultations and multi-level governance. It will be linked to requirements in Georgia&apos;s process of EU-accession, the Copenhagen Criteria and the 
implementation of Agenda 2030.</narrative>
  </description>
